{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-07-19 16:15:00', 'title': 'MARKEM-IMAJE LAUNCHES SMARTLASE C600 CO2 LASER PRINTER', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , JULY 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MARKEM-IMAJE, PART OF DOVER (NYSE: DOV) AND A GLOBAL PROVIDER OF END-TO-END SUPPLY CHAIN SOLUTIONS AND INDUSTRIAL MARKING AND CODING SYSTEMS, RECENTLY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF THE SMARTLASE® C600, THE NEW 60-WATT CO2 LASER PRINTER.'}